BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:screen-australia-global-fellowships-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T151758Z
DTSTART:20270211T053000Z
DTEND:20270211T060000Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 AEDT: Screen Australia Global Fellowships (AUD 80\,0
 00-100\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 11 Feb 2027 at 17:00 AEDT.\n\nScreen Australia's Global 
 Fellowships support Australian screen practitioners (producers\, directors
 \, writers and development executives) pursuing international professional
  development and career acceleration through placements with leading globa
 l screen organizations.\n\nOrganisation: Screen Australia\nLocation: Inter
 national placements with leading global screen organizations\, self-arrang
 ed by the fellow. Open to Australian citizens or permanent residents (sole
  traders) or incorporated Australian companies.\nAward: Non-recoupable gra
 nts of AUD 80\,000 (single continuous placement of up to 6 months) or AUD 
 100\,000 (multiple placements over up to 12 months)\, plus up to AUD 5\,00
 0 for carers' and/or accessibility costs. Up to 10 fellows annually.\nDura
 tion: Placements of up to 6 months (single) or up to 12 months (multiple)\
 n\nMore: https://www.screenaustralia.gov.au/fund/global-fellowships/?utm_s
 ource=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.screenaustralia.gov.au/fund/global-fellowships/?utm_source=
 artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:International placements with leading global screen organizations\
 , self-arranged by the fellow. Open to Australian citizens or permanent re
 sidents (sole traders) or incorporated Australian companies.
END:VEVENT
