 re appropriate\, fees for writer\, producer\, director and story consultan
 t. SUPPORT: up to AUD 30\,000\, or up to AUD 45\,000 with a producer attac
 hed.\n\nOrganisation: Screen Australia\nLocation: Australia. Open to Abori
 ginal and Torres Strait Islander producers\, writers and writer/directors.
 \nAward: Up to AUD 30\,000\, or up to AUD 45\,000 with a producer attached
