 evelopment by Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander key creatives: written
  and visual materials\, treatments\, draft scripts\, series bibles\, resea
 rch\, and fees for writers\, producers\, directors and story consultants.\
 n\nOrganisation: Screen Australia\nLocation: Australia. Open to Australian
  Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander key creatives (writer\, producer or
  director).\nAward: Up to AUD 30\,000 for feature and series documentaries
  intended for commissioning platforms\; up to AUD 20\,000 for one-hour tel
 evision documentaries and for online series. Provided as a grant.\n\nMore:
